- # The `editing`-role articles for one student, shown in place of a completion
- # pill on article-selection exercises (see AssignmentViewContext). Links go out
- # to the live article on the wiki: no username in the URL, unlike a sandbox, so
- # this is safe in every view including the instructor roster.
- #
- # A student who hasn't chosen yet is the state the instructor most needs to see,
- # so it gets its own explicit line rather than an empty cell.
- if articles.empty?
  %span.lti-assigned-article__empty= t('lti.assignment_view.no_article_yet')
- else
  %ul.lti-assigned-articles
    - articles.each do |article|
      %li
        = link_to article.url, target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener' do
          = article.title
          %span.icon.icon-z-external-link{ 'aria-hidden': 'true' }
